      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Frequency</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"> Once per hour</span></p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The forces of Zahoan fiends lie at your fingertips, allowing you to channel their forces to wreathe your arms. When you take this feat, you can surge flame or planar energy along your limbs. Upon using this action, you select one either fire or spirit damage. All your cazic-fer unarmed attacks for the next minute will deal damage of that type.</p>"
